# Differential corpus documents (`pnpm corpus:fetch`).
# NEVER COMMITTED, AND THAT IS A SAFETY DECISION, NOT A SIZE ONE. These are third-party clinical
# examples carrying real-looking names, dates of birth and street addresses. Content committed into
# git history is not undone by a revert, and this repository's PHI scanner treats what git carries
# as self-authored synthetic fixtures, so vendoring them would force its allow-lists (a declaration
# about OUR fixtures) to swallow someone else's document content. `corpus/corpus.json` declares
# them with a digest each; `scripts/corpus-fetch.mjs` retrieves them.
corpus/documents/

# Local
.cache/
.turbo/
dist-artifacts/
